.max(
Comparator.comparing(
Employee::getSalary));


Very common coding question.

26. How to Find Duplicate Elements?
list.stream()

.collect(Collectors.groupingBy(
Function.identity(),
Collectors.counting()))

.entrySet()
.stream()

.filter(e -> e.getValue() > 1)


Banking Interview Favorite.

27. How to Convert List to Map?
employees.stream()

.collect(Collectors.toMap(
Employee::getId,
Employee::getName));


Frequently asked.

28. What is Parallel Stream?
list.parallelStream()


Uses ForkJoinPool.

Benefits:

✅ Multi-core processing

Risks:

❌ Ordering issues

❌ Synchronization overhead

29. Difference Between stream() and parallelStream()?
stream	parallelStreamSingle Thread	Multi Thread
Predictable	Faster for large data
Ordered	May affect ordering
